  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L4-81 Text to Change IAP Entreprenurial support - L4-81 Text to Change Entreprenurial support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L4-81 Text to Change IAP Entreprenursst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;tta upp ett call centre i Uganda som     fokuserar p&#xe5; marknadsunders&#xf6;kningar. The skall anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;ra  marknadsunders&#xf6;kningar som kan f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttre m&#xe4;nniskors levnadsvillkor,   sociala fr&#xe5;gor etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to set up and manage a call centre in Uganda,        focusing on market research which can be used to create social        impacts. Text to Change&#x2019;s (TTC) existing mobile phone platform and    databases will be used as a starting point to develop a               fully-equipped bilingual (English and Kiswahili) call centre.</narrative>
  </description>
